{"4339200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Choiceline Brawl", "steam_appid": 4339200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4510110, 4510120, 4510130, 4510140, 4510150], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based card game, you can expect short, tactical runs with high replayability. At the beginning, you choose one of several heroes, each with their own stats and a unique passive ability that significantly influences your playing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/e7f6fa00ef6aa267748269d9796299b1.poster.avif?t=1783934637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/e7f6fa00ef6aa267748269d9796299b1.webm?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/e7f6fa00ef6aa267748269d9796299b1.mp4?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you put together your personal ability set: from an ever-changing selection, you gradually choose a total of 10 abilities. Every decision counts – synergies, timing, and adapting to upcoming opponents are the keys to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/a8270f6d333181b577038377b7d10c16.poster.avif?t=1783934637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/a8270f6d333181b577038377b7d10c16.webm?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/a8270f6d333181b577038377b7d10c16.mp4?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, you consciously choose an opponent whose abilities and behavior determine the course of the battle. In battle, your abilities are played alternately, ensuring exciting, dynamic duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/c862396bfdcc6b012dec54774484f517.poster.avif?t=1783934637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/c862396bfdcc6b012dec54774484f517.webm?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/c862396bfdcc6b012dec54774484f517.mp4?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, you can buy packs in the shop, unlock new cards, and constantly expand your strategic repertoire. Perfect for short sessions – but with enough depth for long-term motivation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/36268b0a85a625f31d33caa9e518fedb.poster.avif?t=1783934637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/36268b0a85a625f31d33caa9e518fedb.webm?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/36268b0a85a625f31d33caa9e518fedb.mp4?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based card game, you can expect short, tactical runs with high replayability. At the beginning, you choose one of several heroes, each with their own stats and a unique passive ability that significantly influences your playing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/e7f6fa00ef6aa267748269d9796299b1.poster.avif?t=1783934637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/e7f6fa00ef6aa267748269d9796299b1.webm?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/e7f6fa00ef6aa267748269d9796299b1.mp4?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you put together your personal ability set: from an ever-changing selection, you gradually choose a total of 10 abilities. Every decision counts – synergies, timing, and adapting to upcoming opponents are the keys to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/a8270f6d333181b577038377b7d10c16.poster.avif?t=1783934637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/a8270f6d333181b577038377b7d10c16.webm?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/a8270f6d333181b577038377b7d10c16.mp4?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, you consciously choose an opponent whose abilities and behavior determine the course of the battle. In battle, your abilities are played alternately, ensuring exciting, dynamic duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/c862396bfdcc6b012dec54774484f517.poster.avif?t=1783934637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/c862396bfdcc6b012dec54774484f517.webm?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/c862396bfdcc6b012dec54774484f517.mp4?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, you can buy packs in the shop, unlock new cards, and constantly expand your strategic repertoire. Perfect for short sessions – but with enough depth for long-term motivation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/36268b0a85a625f31d33caa9e518fedb.poster.avif?t=1783934637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/36268b0a85a625f31d33caa9e518fedb.webm?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/extras/36268b0a85a625f31d33caa9e518fedb.mp4?t=1783934637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Turn-based card game with fast runs: Choose one of many heroes with unique passive abilities, build your deck from 10 abilities, and face tactically selected opponents. Fight, unlock cards, and dominate short battles.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339200/262199b